ligand affinity assay, a unique terminal target-gene occupancy result, or an SCI receiver-cell effect.', 'The artifact has an exact identifier match to a Phase-2 row with validated observation and validated claim statuses. Matched identifiers are recorded for audit; filename tokens and database links alone are not treated as claim support.' FROM EvidenceArtifact WHERE relative_path='data/raw/evidence/module20_24_supervised_cli_phase2/retry_B21B_B22B_fulltext/html/PMC1170167.html' AND NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM EvidenceArtifactAdjudication x WHERE x.artifact_id=EvidenceArtifact.artifact_id AND x.module='21B' AND x.register_evidence_id='M21B-EVID-000007' AND x.extraction_id='M21B-P2-R-000007');
INSERT INTO EvidenceArtifactAdjudication (artifact_id, module, register_edge_id, register_evidence_id, extraction_id, canonical_paper_key, resolved_pmid, artifact_role, paper_match_status, artifact_support_status, evidence_grade, context_level, observation_status, claim_status, source_locator, candidate_observation_snippet, candidate_claim_snippet, adjudication_basis) SELECT artifact_id, '', '', '', '', '', NULL, 'full_text_html', 'not_attempted', 'unmapped_source_artifact', NULL, NULL, '', '', '', '', '', 'No conservative register crosswalk exists for this artifact.' FROM EvidenceArtifact WHERE relative_path='data/raw/evidence/module20_24_supervised_cli_phase2/retry_B21B_B22B_fulltext/html/PMC1171330.html' AND NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM EvidenceArtifactAdjudication x WHERE x.artifact_id=EvidenceArtifact.artifact_id AND x.module='' AND x.register_evidence_id='' AND x.extraction_id='');
INSERT INTO EvidenceArtifactAdjudication (artifact_id, module, register_edge_id, register_evidence_id, extraction_id, canonical_paper_key, resolved_pmid, artifact_role, paper_match_status, artifact_support_status, evidence_grade, context_level, observation_status, claim_status, source_locator, candidate_observation_snippet, candidate_claim_snippet, adjudication_basis) SELECT artifact_id, '22B', 'M22B-E000431', 'M22B-EVID-000001', 'M22B-P2-R-000001', 'PMCID:PMC2441693; PMID:16718380; DOI:10.1007/s11010-006-9137-3', '16718380', 'full_text_html', 'exact_identifier_match:DOI:10.1007/s11010-006-9137-3;PMCID:PMC2441693', 'candidate_requires_review', 'B', 'L1', 'abstract_only_not_import_ready', 'abstract_only_not_import_ready', 'PMCID:PMC2441693; PMID:16718380; DOI:10.1007/s11010-006-9137-3; local cache=data/raw/evidence/module20_24_supervised_cli_phase2/M22B_batch001_pubmed.xml; BioC retry=data/raw/evidence/module20_24_supervised_cli_phase2/M22B_16718380_PMC2441693.json', 'The retained PubMed abstract reports IL-6-induced STAT3 activation and Socs3 expression in Stat3-null MEF reconstitution systems, with STAT3 binding at the Socs3 promoter and an N-domain deletion mutant retaining Socs3 induction. The abstract does not provide an atomic figure/section passage for import.', 'The abstract supports a STAT3-to-Socs3 transcriptional lead, but exact author interpretation and figure-level promoter evidence require complete primary text.', 'The artifact is linked to a resolved paper-level review row, but the observation and claim gates are not both satisfied. Matched identifiers are recorded for audit; filename tokens and database links alone are not treated as claim support.' FROM EvidenceArtifact WHERE relative_path='data/raw/evidence/module20_24_supervised_cli_phase2/retry_B21B_B22B_fulltext/html/PMC2441693.html' AND NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM EvidenceArtifactAdjudication x WHERE x.artifact_id=EvidenceArtifact.artifact_id AND x.module='22B' AND x.register_evidence_id='M22B-EVID-000001' AND x.extraction_id='M22B-P2-R-000001');
INSERT INTO EvidenceArtifactAdjudication (artifact_id, module, register_edge_id, register_evidence_id, extraction_id, canonical_paper_key, resolved_pmid, artifact_role, paper_match_status, artifact_support_status, evidence_grade, context_level, observation_status, claim_status, source_locator, candidate_observation_snippet, candidate_claim_snippet, adjudication_basis) SELECT artifact_id, '22B', 'M22B-E000431', 'M22B-EVID-000001', 'M22B-P2-R-000001-R098', 'PMCID:PMC2441693; PMID:16718380; DOI:10.1007/s11010-006-9137-3', '16718380', 'full_text_html', 'exact_identifier_match:DOI:10.1007/s11010-006-9137-3;PMCID:PMC2441693', 'supporting_validated_claim', 'B', 'L1', 'validated_primary_observation', 'VALIDATED_DIRECT_TF_TARGET', 'PMCID:PMC2441693; PMID:16718380; DOI:10.1007/s11010-006-9137-3; local=data/raw/evidence/module20_24_supervised_cli_phase2/M22B_16718380_PMC2441693.json', 'Cytokine stimulation activated STAT3 and induced SOCS3 expression; STAT3-dependent promoter regulation and SOCS3 feedback were supported by perturbation and promoter assays.', 'The primary full text supports a shared STAT3-to-Socs3 regulatory edge, strongest in the tested cytokine context, but does not prove that every submitted IL-20/IL-21/IL-24/IL-6/LIF handoff induces Socs3 in the same SCI receiver cell.', 'The artifact has an exact identifier match to a Phase-2 row with validated observation and validated claim statuses. Matched identifiers are recorded for audit; filename tokens and database links alone are not treated as claim support.' FROM EvidenceArtifact WHERE relative_path='data/raw/evidence/module20_24_supervised_cli_phase2/retry_B21B_B22B_fulltext/html/PMC2441693.html' AND NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM EvidenceArtifactAdjudication x WHERE x.artifact_id=EvidenceArtifact.artifact_id AND x.module='22B' AND x.register_evidence_id='M22B-EVID-000001' AND x.extraction_id='M22B-P2-R-000001-R098');
INSERT INTO EvidenceArtifactAdjudication (artifact_id, module, register_edge_id, register_evidence_id, extraction_id, canonical_paper_key, resolved_pmid, artifact_role, paper_match_status, artifact_support_status, evidence_grade, context_level, observation_status, claim_status, source_locator, candidate_observation_snippet, candidate_claim_snippet, adjudication_basis) SELECT artifact_id, '22B', 'M22B-E000431', 'M22B-EVID-000001', 'M22B-P2-R-RECOVERY-STAT3-SOCS3-000001', 'PMCID:PMC2441693; PMID:16718380; DOI:10.1007/s11010-006-9137-3', '16718380', 'full_text_html', 'exact_identifier_match:DOI:10.1007/s11010-006-9137-3;PMCID:PMC2441693', 'supporting_validated_claim', 'B', 'L1', 'validated_full_text_importable', 'validated_author_claim', 'PMCID:PMC2441693; PMID:16718380; DOI:10.1007/s11010-006-9137-3; local full text=data/raw/evidence/module20_24_supervised_cli_phase2/retry_B21B_B22B_fulltext/html/PMC2441693.html', 'IL-6 plus soluble IL-6 receptor induced SOCS3 expression in Stat3+/− and STAT3-reconstituted Stat3−/− mouse embryonic fibroblasts but not Stat3−/− cells; EMSA showed activated STAT3 binding predominantly to the proximal Socs3 promoter STAT motif, with competition and anti-STAT3 supershift controls.', 'The authors conclude that STAT3 interaction at the proximal Socs3 promoter motif is sufficient for IL-6-dependent Socs3 activation and that the STAT3 N-domain is dispensable for this response; this is a STAT3-to-Socs3 target-gene result, not evidence that every upstream ligand-receptor pair induces Socs3 in SCI.', 'The artifact has an exact identifier match to a Phase-2 row with validated observation and validated claim statuses. Matched identifiers are recorded for audit; filename tokens and database links alone are not treated as claim support.' FROM EvidenceArtifact WHERE relative_path='data/raw/evidence/module20_24_supervised_cli_phase2/retry_B21B_B22B_fulltext/html/PMC2441693.html' AND NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM EvidenceArtifactAdjudication x WHERE x.artifact_id=EvidenceArtifact.artifact_id AND x.module='22B' AND x.register_evidence_id='M22B-EVID-000001' AND x.extraction_id='M22B-P2-R-RECOVERY-STAT3-SOCS3-000001');
INSERT INTO EvidenceArtifactAdjudication (artifact_id, module, register_edge_id, register_evidence_id, extraction_id, canonical_paper_key, resolved_pmid, artifact_role, paper_match_status, artifact_support_status, evidence_grade, context_level, observation_status, claim_status, source_locator, candidate_observation_snippet, candidate_claim_snippet, adjudication_basis) SELECT artifact_id, '22B', 'M22B-E000431', 'M22B-EVID-000001', 'M22B-P2-R-RECOVERY-STAT3-SOCS3-000002', 'PMID:16718380; PMCID:PMC2441693; DOI:10.1007/s11010-006-9137-3', '16718380', 'full_text_html', 'exact_identifier_match:DOI:10.1007/s11010-006-9137-3;PMCID:PMC2441693', 'supporting_validated_claim', 'B', 'L1', 'validated_primary_observation', 'validated_direct_tf_target', 'PMID:16718380; PMCID:PMC2441693; DOI:10.1007/s11010-006-9137-3; https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/16718380/; https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC2441693/; local source=data/raw/evidence/module20_24_supervised_cli_phase2/retry_B22B_batch063_PMC2441693_STAT3_Socs3.html', 'IL-6 plus soluble IL-6 receptor activated STAT3 in Stat3-null mouse embryonic fibroblasts reconstituted with STAT3 or Delta133STAT3. Northern blot and quantitative PCR showed endogenous Socs3 induction only with STAT3-containing cells. EMSA with murine Socs3 promoter oligonucleotides showed STAT3 interaction primarily at the proximal STAT consensus site; excess intact competitor blocked binding, anti-STAT3 partially supershifted the complex, and mutation of the proximal site prevented competition. Delta133STAT3 retained IL-6-dependent Socs3 induction, so the STAT3 N-domain was not required for this target-gene output.', 'Retain a direct STAT3 -> Socs3 promoter/target-gene edge in the tested IL-6-responsive mouse comparator. Do not infer that every IL-6-family ligand-receptor handoff induces Socs3 in the same SCI receiver cell, that receptor-proximal pSTAT3 alone proves promoter occupancy, or that the study identifies a downstream TF beyond STAT3.', 'The artifact has an exact identifier match to a Phase-2 row with validated observation and validated claim statuses. Matched identifiers are recorded for audit; filename tokens and database links alone are not treated as claim support.' FROM EvidenceArtifact WHERE relative_path='data/raw/evidence/module20_24_supervised_cli_phase2/retry_B21B_B22B_fulltext/html/PMC2441693.html' AND NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM EvidenceArtifactAdjudication x WHERE x.artifact_id=EvidenceArtifact.artifact_id AND x.module='22B' AND x.register_evidence_id='M22B-EVID-000001' AND x.extraction_id='M22B-P2-R-RECOVERY-STAT3-SOCS3-000002');
INSERT INTO EvidenceArtifactAdjudication (artifact_id, module, register_edge_id, register_evidence_id, extraction_id, canonical_paper_key, resolved_pmid, artifact_role, paper_match_status, artifact_support_status, evidence_grade, context_level, observation_status, claim_status, source_locator, candidate_observation_snippet, candidate_claim_snippet, adjudication_basis) SELECT artifact_id, '22B', 'M22B-E000431', 'M22B-EVID-000027', 'M22B-P2-R-000027', 'PMID:16718380; PMCID:PMC2441693; DOI:10.1007/s11010-006-9137-3', '16718380', 'full_text_html', 'exact_identifier_match:DOI:10.1007/s11010-006-9137-3;PMCID:PMC2441693', 'candidate_requires_review', NULL, 'L1', 'unresolved', 'unresolved', 'PMID:16718380; PMCID:PMC2441693; DOI:10.1007/s11010-006-9137-3', 'A prior abstract-only retrieval exists for this source family, but this distinct handoff row requires an exact primary passage for the shared STAT3-to-Socs3 claim and no retained full-text passage was available through the supervised CLI cache.', 'Do not reuse the abstract-only or B-layer summary as an import-ready direct STAT3-to-Socs3 record for this distinct edge row.', 'The artifact is linked to a resolved paper-level review row, but the observation and claim gates are not both satisfied. Matched identifiers are recorded for audit; filename tokens and database links alone are not treated as claim support.' FROM EvidenceArtifact WHERE relative_path='data/raw/evidence/module20_24_supervised_cli_phase2/retry_B21B_B22B_fulltext/html/PMC2441693.html' AND NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM EvidenceArtifactAdjudication x WHERE x.artifact_id=EvidenceArtifact.artifact_id AND x.module='22B' AND x.register_evidence_id='M22B-EVID-000027' AND x.extraction_id='M22B-P2-R-000027');
INSERT INTO EvidenceArtifactAdjudication (artifact_id, module, register_edge_id, register_evidence_id, extraction_id, canonical_paper_key, resolved_pmid, artifact_role, paper_match_status, artifact_support_status, evidence_grade, context_level, observation_status, claim_status, source_locator, candidate_observation_snippet, candidate_claim_snippet, adjudication_basis) SELECT artifact_id, '22B', 'M22B-E000431', 'M22B-EVID-000027', 'M22B-P2-R-000027-R089', 'PMCID:PMC2441693; PMID:16718380; DOI:10.1007/s11010-006-9137-3', '16718380', 'full_text_html', 'exact_identifier_match:DOI:10.1007/s11010-006-9137-3;PMCID:PMC2441693', 'linked_unresolved', NULL, 'L1', 'reuse_validated_observation', 'REUSE_DIRECT_TF_TARGET', 'PMCID:PMC2441693; PMID:16718380; DOI:10.1007/s11010-006-9137-3; local=data/raw/evidence/module20_24_supervised_cli_phase2/retry_external_PMC2441693.html', 'Reuse the validated STAT3-to-Socs3 primary observation for the repeated handoff; the exact shared TF-level result is supported, but no new ligand-receptor-specific Socs3 experiment is created.', 'Reuse the validated direct STAT3-to-Socs3 promoter observation without asserting that each submitted IL-20/IL-21/IL-24/IL-6/LIF receptor handoff induces Socs3 in an SCI receiver cell.', 'The artifact is linked to a Phase-2 evidence row, but the paper, observation, or claim remains unresolved. Matched identifiers are recorded for audit; filename tokens and database links alone are not treated as claim support.' FROM EvidenceArtifact WHERE relative_path='data/raw/evidence/module20_24_supervised_cli_phase2/retry_B21B_B22B_fulltext/html/PMC2441693.html' AND NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM EvidenceArtifactAdjudication x WHERE x.artifact_id=EvidenceArtifact.artifact_id AND x.module='22B' AND x.register_evidence_id='M22B-EVID-000027' AND x.extraction_id='M22B-P2-R-000027-R089');
INSERT INTO EvidenceArtifactAdjudication (artifact_id, module, register_edge_id, register_evidence_id, extraction_id, canonical_paper_key, resolved_pmid, artifact_role, paper_match_status, artifact_support_status, evidence_grade, context_level, observation_status, claim_status, source_locator, candidate_observation_snippet, candidate_claim_snippet, adjudication_basis) SELECT artifact_id, '22B', 'M22B-E000431', 'M22B-EVID-000057', 'M22B-P2-B090-001', 'PMID:16718380; PMCID:PMC2441693; DOI:10.1007/s11010-006-9137-3', '16718380', 'full_text_html', 'exact_identifier_match:DOI:10.1007/s11010-006-9137-3;PMCID:PMC2441693', 'supporting_validated_claim', 'B', 'L1', 'validated_fulltext', 'validated_fulltext', 'https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC2441693/; https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/16718380/', 'IL-6 plus soluble IL-6 receptor induced STAT3 phosphorylation and endogenous Socs3 expression in Stat3-deficient mouse embryonic fibroblasts reconstituted with wild-type STAT3 or Delta133STAT3, but not in unreconstituted Stat3-deficient cells. Electrophoretic mobility-shift assays showed STAT3 binding predominantly at the proximal STAT consensus element of the Socs3 promoter; the Delta133STAT3 mutant retained this promoter response.', 'The authors conclude that IL-6/STAT3 activates Socs3 and that STAT3 interaction at the proximal Socs3 promoter element is sufficient for the tested response; STAT3 N-domain sequences are dispensable in this context. This is direct STAT3-to-Socs3 target evidence, not proof that every queued ligand-receptor handoff induces Socs3 in SCI astrocytes.', 'The artifact has an exact identifier match to a Phase-2 row with validated observation and validated claim statuses. Matched identifiers are recorded for audit; filename tokens and database links alone are not treated as claim support.' FROM EvidenceArtifact WHERE relative_path='data/raw/evidence/module20_24_supervised_cli_phase2/retry_B21B_B22B_fulltext/html/PMC2441693.html' AND NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM EvidenceArtifactAdjudication x WHERE x.artifact_id=EvidenceArtifact.artifact_id AND x.module='22B' AND x.register_evidence_id='M22B-EVID-000057' AND x.extraction_id='M22B-P2-B090-001');
